      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "A frequent oversight is neglecting to properly label custom components, such as icons or buttons without visible text; these need descriptive `aria-label` attributes. Another common mistake is not managing focus order logically, which can confuse users navigating with the keyboard or screen reader. Finally, ensuring dynamic content updates (like error messages) correctly announce themselves to the user via `aria-live` regions is crucial for a good experience.",
